# 2026-08-10 16:25:41.738129
+Handover Architecture Document                                                                                                       
+
+Design Choices                                                                                                                       
+
+ 1 Local RAG System                                                                                                                  
+    • Uses local file system for document storage.                                                                                   
+    • Implements ColPali for visual embeddings.                                                                                      
+    • Uses batching for efficient processing.                                                                                        
+    • Maintains separate embedding and graph building layers.                                                                        
+ 2 Files Modified                                                                                                                    
+    • src/pdf_ingestion/colpali_embedder.py: Modified to handle batching and MinIO fallback.                                         
+    • src/pdf_ingestion/image_store.py: Implemented both local and MinIO storage.                                                    
+    • src/pdf_ingestion/graph_builder.py: Started implementing graph building logic.                                                 
+ 3 Key Constraints                                                                                                                   
+    • Token limit of 10k embeddings.                                                                                                 
+    • Batch size limits (2-4 pages).                                                                                                 
+    • Asynchronous processing for token management.                                                                                  
+    • Caching for frequently accessed data.                                                                                          
+ 4 Next Steps                                                                                                                        
+    • Implement caching layer.                                                                                                       
+    • Finalize ColPali integration.                                                                                                  
+    • Test with smaller batches to stay under token limit.                                                                           
+    • Document everything in Handover Document.          

