+Let's refactor our pipeline architecture to ensure strict isolation between the textual graph layer and the visual embedding layer. Edit the relevant ingestion scripts to make sure `GraphBuilder` runs completely independently of `generate_colpali_embeddings`. Do NOT use ColPali visual embeddings for knowledge graph construction. Ensure that text chunks are routed to Memgraph as clean symbolic string triples (Subject, Predicate, Object), while ColPali page images are processed purely as multi-vectors into Qdrant. The only link between them must be shared global metadata keys (`document_id` and `page_number`).
+

